8:32Z","body":"@akien-mga I know you are busy so sorry for ping but just want to make sure it wasn't lost in void","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486282725/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495873658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99055#issuecomment-2495873658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99055","id":2495873658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UxAJ6","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-24T08:39:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-24T08:39:28Z","body":"I am not going to do anything to update this PR. But it is not bad in IMO so I am not closing it... Over time some merge conflicts can occur... There are people with \"write access\" so if you need it you can correct it. I am abandoning this PR... If you want close it\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI generally want this to be merged but if you will do it, do it on your own risk. I won't do anything if there is any new bugs will be introduced or anything else...","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495873658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499711137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99055#issuecomment-2499711137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99055","id":2499711137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U_pCh","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T05:43:15Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T05:43:39Z","body":"Github send me notification so I am here :sweat_smile:. Looks like I can abandon anything except this PR :sweat_smile:.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n@Repiteo I saw your PR and it is great but it would be a mistake. Why? Because as I mentioned somewhere in this PR `user_args` is a silver bullet for several places. It is not a first time we need to know if it is a user provided argument or not... Just look at original akien's PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91794. There we need `user_flags` to determine if we can or cannot override value from `platform_args`. We just need `user_args` anyway. Additionally look at this code:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d09d82d433b03bb3773fd2a8cc8d6ccc2f8739ce/SConstruct#L595-L609\r\n\r\nWrite in `custom.py` `verbose=\"no\"` and run `scons dev_mode=\"yes\"` and you will see it is still verbose... If you run  `scons dev_mode=\"yes\" verbose=\"no\"`, it will work as expected. But it can be tackled by replacing usage of `ARGUMENTS` with `user_args`... And it is not the end there are some more placer where `user_args` will be helpful. Though can't say that for other places `user_args` is the only option but in some places it could easier life... So while I agree that that conditional `scons > (4.8.1)` is more native to SCons, I don't agree we need to choose that way (but I agree that we need to add comment that from 4.8.1 scons supports unknown variables from files...)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499711137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]